---
config:
  theme: default
title: Application Tracking Sequence
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant TrackerPage
    participant API
    participant Backend
    participant MongoDB
    participant SocketIO
    
    %% Load Tracker Page
    Note over User,SocketIO: Load Application Tracker
    User->>TrackerPage: Navigate to /tracker
    TrackerPage->>API: GET /api/tracker/applications
    API->>Backend: Request with JWT token
    Backend->>MongoDB: db.applications.find(userId)
    MongoDB-->>Backend: User's applications
    Backend-->>API: 200 OK + applications array
    API-->>TrackerPage: Applications data
    TrackerPage->>User: Display Kanban board
    
    %% Add New Application
    Note over User,SocketIO: Add New Application
    User->>TrackerPage: Click "Add Application"
    TrackerPage->>User: Show form modal
    User->>TrackerPage: Fill form:<br/>Company, Role, Date, Status
    TrackerPage->>API: POST /api/tracker/applications
    API->>Backend: Create application
    Backend->>MongoDB: db.applications.insertOne()
    MongoDB-->>Backend: Application created with _id
    Backend->>Backend: Set initial status: "Applied"
    Backend-->>API: 201 Created + application
    API-->>TrackerPage: New application data
    TrackerPage->>TrackerPage: Add to Kanban board
    TrackerPage->>User: Show success notification
    
    %% Update Application Status
    Note over User,SocketIO: Update Status (Drag & Drop)
    User->>TrackerPage: Drag card to "Interview" column
    TrackerPage->>API: PATCH /api/tracker/applications/:id
    API->>Backend: {status: "Interview"}
    Backend->>MongoDB: db.applications.findById(id)
    MongoDB-->>Backend: Current application
    Backend->>Backend: Validate status transition
    alt Valid transition
        Backend->>MongoDB: updateOne()<br/>$set status<br/>$push statusHistory
        MongoDB-->>Backend: Application updated
        Backend->>SocketIO: Emit application.updated event
        SocketIO-->>TrackerPage: Real-time update
        Backend-->>API: 200 OK + updated application
        API-->>TrackerPage: Confirmation
        TrackerPage->>User: Show in new column
    else Invalid transition
        Backend-->>API: 400 Bad Request
        API-->>TrackerPage: Error message
        TrackerPage->>TrackerPage: Revert drag
        TrackerPage->>User: Show error notification
    end
    
    %% Add Notes to Application
    Note over User,SocketIO: Add Notes
    User->>TrackerPage: Click "Add Note" on card
    TrackerPage->>User: Show note input
    User->>TrackerPage: Enter note text
    TrackerPage->>API: POST /api/tracker/applications/:id/notes
    API->>Backend: {note: "Interview scheduled"}
    Backend->>MongoDB: updateOne()<br/>$push notes array
    MongoDB-->>Backend: Note added
    Backend-->>API: 200 OK
    API-->>TrackerPage: Update local state
    TrackerPage->>User: Display note on card
    
    %% View Application Details
    Note over User,SocketIO: View Full Details
    User->>TrackerPage: Click application card
    TrackerPage->>API: GET /api/tracker/applications/:id
    API->>Backend: Fetch single application
    Backend->>MongoDB: db.applications.findById(id)
    MongoDB-->>Backend: Application with full history
    Backend-->>API: 200 OK + application
    API-->>TrackerPage: Full data
    TrackerPage->>User: Show detail modal:<br/>Timeline, Notes, Documents
    
    %% Delete Application
    Note over User,SocketIO: Delete Application
    User->>TrackerPage: Click "Delete" button
    TrackerPage->>User: Show confirmation dialog
    User->>TrackerPage: Confirm deletion
    TrackerPage->>API: DELETE /api/tracker/applications/:id
    API->>Backend: Delete request
    Backend->>MongoDB: db.applications.deleteOne(id)
    MongoDB-->>Backend: Deleted count: 1
    Backend-->>API: 204 No Content
    API-->>TrackerPage: Success
    TrackerPage->>TrackerPage: Remove from Kanban
    TrackerPage->>User: Show deletion confirmation
